{"id":"426208","name":"芋头西兰花鸡汤","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/426208/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸡肉汤","amount":"适量"},{"name":"母芋头","amount":"1个"},{"name":"西兰花","amount":"60克"},{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"40克"}],"sub":[{"name":"花生油","amount":"3克"},{"name":"食盐","amount":"0.5克"},{"name":"鸡精","amount":"小许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"母芋头一个。","img":"images/426208/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"去皮洗净切块，胡萝卜洗净，切块。","img":"images/426208/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"热锅冷油。","img":"images/426208/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"倒入芋头和胡萝卜翻炒。","img":"images/426208/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放食盐。","img":"images/426208/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"翻炒至芋头微黄。","img":"images/426208/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"剩的鸡块鸡汤。","img":"images/426208/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加清水一起倒入锅里。","img":"images/426208/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"差不多跟食材持平即可，盖锅盖，中小火炖25分钟。","img":"images/426208/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"炖至汤汁浓郁，芋头熟透。","img":"images/426208/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"西兰花洗净。","img":"images/426208/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"掰成小块。","img":"images/426208/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"放芋头里。","img":"images/426208/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"大火烧开，放鸡精提味即可。","img":"images/426208/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"装盘。","img":"images/426208/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/426208/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/426208/step_17.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}